  "title": "Abraham Lincoln conducts flight operations during Jungle Warfare 2022",
  "description": "PHILIPPINE SEA (Feb. 17, 2022) U.S. Navy Sailors conduct flight operations on the flight deck of the Nimitz-class aircraft carrier USS Abraham Lincoln (CVN 72) in support of Jungle Warfare Exercise 22 (JWX 22) across Okinawa, Japan. JWX 22 is a large-scale field training exercise focused on leveraging the integrated capabilities of joint and allied partners to strengthen all-domain awareness, maneuver, and fires across a distributed maritime environment. (U.S. Navy video by Mass Communication Specialist 3rd Class Jeremiah Bartelt)",
